repository-code: "https://github.com/skunal3318/Ramp-Autonomy"
abstract: >-
  A ROS 2 / Gazebo stack for ramp ascent and descent on a loaded wheeled AMR,
  covering the pitch-bias, shifting centre-of-gravity and wheel-slip failure
  modes that flat-floor navigation does not handle.
